Interactability_Text_Line_2 Coalition Threatens Aid Suspencion for Brazil
Interactability_Text_Line_3 The South American Office of the International Coalition has issued a memorandum warning Brazilian authorities that aid for the country might be cut after a leaked report suggested that nearly one fourth of all aid for November 'simply vanished'.